    summary_60s: 'Introduction to the classical tradition in drama, major playwrights and theorists of the classical tradition such as Sophocles, Aeschylus, Euripides, Aristophanes and Aristotle, with reference to recommended texts including Sophocles’ King Oedipus and Antigone for illustrating ba',
