    summary_60s: 'American Drama (The Modern Tradition) Background to American drama with reference to Arthur Miller, Tennessee Williams, August Wilson and Amiri Baraka. August Wilson and Amiri Baraka, including drama in modern American society. Textual studies involving an in-depth analysis of Wi',
