    summary_60s: 'PROSE FICTION PROSE Meaning and Nature of Prose Prose is the most common and natural form of language use. The term derives from the Latin word prosa , meaning straightforward . Prose therefore refers to language presented in a direct, ordinary manner, similar to everyday speech,',
