    summary_60s: '9. African Prose (Modern African Novel) Background to the modern African novel with reference to Chinua Achebe, Wole Soyinka, Elechi Amadi, Ngũgĩ wa Thiong’o, Ayi Kwei Armah and Sembene Ousmane. Study of Chinua Achebe’s A Man of the People and Ngũgĩ wa Thiong’o’s A Grain of Wheat',
