    summary_60s: 'Background to African poetry including oral and written traditions and the interface between oral and written forms. Anonymity and authorship, with examples from Wole Soyinka, Christopher Okigbo, Kofi Awoonor, Dennis Brutus and Mazisi Kunene. Textual studies including Soyinka’s T',
