    subtopic: 'Poetry',
    summary_60s: 'Poetry is a unique form of literary expression that uses carefully chosen words to convey deep meanings, stir emotions, and create beauty. Unlike prose, poetry focuses on musicality, structure, and symbolism to express complex ideas in a compact and artistic way. Nature of Poetry',
